---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = "French Riviera Tips | Affiliate Disclosure | French Riviera";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description="How French Riviera Tips uses affiliate links, and our commitment to honest, unpaid recommendations.">
  <main class="wrap" style="padding-top:40px;max-width:760px;padding-bottom:40px">
    <nav style="font-size:13px;color:var(--faint);display:flex;gap:8px"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Affiliate disclosure</span></nav>
    <h1 style="font-weight:800;font-size:38px;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin-top:20px">Affiliate disclosure</h1>
    <div class="prose" style="margin-top:20px">
      <p>French Riviera Tips is a free, independent travel site. To cover our costs, some of the links on this website are <strong>affiliate links</strong>. If you click one and make a booking or purchase, we may earn a small commission — <strong>at no extra cost to you</strong>. It never changes the price you pay.</p>
      <h2>Our promise</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We only recommend places and services we genuinely believe are worth your time.</li>
        <li>We do <strong>not</strong> accept payment in exchange for positive reviews.</li>
        <li>A recommendation is never influenced by whether a partner offers a commission.</li>
        <li>Every affiliate link is marked <code>rel="sponsored nofollow"</code> and opens in a new tab.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Partners we work with</h2>
      <p>Our affiliate partners include <strong>Stay22</strong> (hotel comparison maps), <strong>Booking.com</strong> and <strong>Expedia</strong> (accommodation), and <strong>Travelpayouts</strong> and its network (flights, airport transfers, car hire and activities). Where a page contains affiliate links, you'll also see a short notice near the top of the article.</p>
      <p>Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:hello@frenchrivieratips.com">hello@frenchrivieratips.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
